1
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:09,490
It's from Lady Mireille.

2
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:15,510
She is of the same opinion, Prince Christopher.

3
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:27,670
What remained in the Totti Caves was the murals
of the Gael Civilization, said to be the most ancient.

4
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:34,430
The Kai Arg Empire set out on continental domination,
the defeated country was admonished for idolatry,

5
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:38,560
and history books say
that all the wall paintings were destroyed.

6
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:41,560
I wish there were some left.

7
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,480
Yeah.

8
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:45,990
Eli? What's wrong?

9
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:48,330
It's nothing.

10
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:53,070
You're usually feeling pretty down
whenever you want to drink hot cocoa with me.

11
00:00:53,590 --> 00:00:55,080
Alfred…

12
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:58,450
Tell me, what happened?

13
00:01:01,870 --> 00:01:04,500
Lady Anna, it's all right.

14
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:08,970
I was just thinking that I should
speak to the Prince about something.

15
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:13,470
I see… If there's anything I can do, let me know.

16
00:01:13,770 --> 00:01:17,220
Me too, I'll help you with anything I can.

17
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:22,980
Okay. I appreciate it, Lady Anna, Alfred.

18
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:25,730
Here you are, Lady Elianna.

19
00:01:26,180 --> 00:01:27,820
Lord Alexei.

20
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:28,740
If you have the time…

21
00:01:30,670 --> 00:01:34,120
Can you deliver these documents
to their respective places?

22
00:01:34,710 --> 00:01:36,580
Okay.

23
00:01:36,580 --> 00:01:40,000
There's a shortage of workers right now…

